  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of School Zones to Ensure Children&apos;s Traffic Safety and Capacity-Building in Ulaanbaatar Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">* Support for school zone related legal system environment,* Securing a safe school zone environment,* Raising traffic safety awareness,* Strengthening traffic safety management capacity</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to: improve the traffic safety of children in school zones in Mongolia by establishing a comprehensive school zone safety plan, developing a maintenance manual, implementing a school zone safety pilot project, developing and promoting traffic safety education content, and strengthening the capacity of school zone officials. Enhancement of traffic safety policies for children in test-bed schools of Ulaanbaatar with school zones.&#xC2A4;&#xCFE8;&#xC874; &#xC5B4;&#xB9B0;&#xC774; &#xAD50;&#xD1B5;&#xC548;&#xC804; &#xC778;&#xD504;&#xB77C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xC2A4;&#xCFE8;&#xC874; &#xC5B4;&#xB9B0;&#xC774; &#xAD50;&#xD1B5;&#xC548;&#xC804; &#xC758;&#xC2DD; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;</narrative>
  </description>
